# Source layout

- All Go code, `go.mod`, and examples live under `source/`.
- Do not place `.go` files or `go.mod` at the repository root.
- Build/test from `source/`: `go build ./...`, `go test ./...`.
- Package import path remains `github.com/anvil-dev/anvil` (module root = `source/`).
